# Website architecture

This is a multi-page site. Every destination has its own URL. Do not ship PrintSahaj as a one-page homepage with hash-only sections for Solutions, Products, Tools, Work, Insights, About, or Contact.

Every page must answer whether the visitor is looking for a product, a business solution, a marketing/growth solution, a tool, or a custom project.

Stack: Next.js App Router in `web/` (`output: "export"`), Tailwind v4 tokens in `globals.css`, copy in `web/content/*.ts`. Edit copy in content files, not inside JSX.

Keep two chrome systems until a deliberate unification: `SiteNav` + `SiteFooter` on `/`; `Navbar` + `Footer` on `(pages)`. Prefer the landing visual language (tokens, `CtaButton`, `Logo` SVG) when adding brand pages.

Do not rewrite PrintVerify: `/tools/artwork-verification` and `web/content/tools.ts` (`artworkTool`). `/verification` redirects there. Do not change Hostinger/Firebase deploy config unless asked.

Target IA (implement only when a later task asks; each is a real page, not a homepage anchor):

- `/` company homepage (overview + links)
- `/products` `/products/printverify` `/products/flexora`
- `/solutions` software, AI, Digital Growth & Marketing, custom
- `/tools` calculators and tools
- `/work` `/insights` `/about` `/contact`

Existing PrintVerify URL `/tools/artwork-verification` stays until a move is approved. `/verification` redirects there.

Primary global CTA: "Start a Project". Do not use Pricing as a primary nav item.

Logo: header uses inline SVG `Logo.tsx` at 30px (`size="sm"`) — too small. PNGs in `web/public/assets/` have large white canvases; do not drop them into a dark header uncropped. Do not distort the mark.

Footer and company chrome must describe PrintSahaj around Technology, AI, Automation, Digital Growth & Marketing, business systems, digital solutions, and printing & packaging expertise. Never use "verification system for India's printing and packaging industry" for the company.

## Content model (plan; create files only when implementation is approved)

Do not duplicate the same copy across components. Keep content out of JSX.

```
web/content/
  site.ts       global chrome/config
  home.ts       homepage-only sections
  products.ts
  solutions.ts
  work.ts
  tools.ts      existing PrintVerify tool copy — do not rewrite artworkTool
  insights.ts
```

`site.ts`: brand metadata, navigation, page-intent labels, global CTAs, footer, contact placeholders/config, global SEO defaults.

`home.ts`: hero, what is PrintSahaj, four pillars, selected products, Digital Growth & Marketing, printing & packaging specialization, selected work references, founder, optional currently-building, final CTA.

Contact: do not expose the placeholder WhatsApp number or an unconfirmed email publicly.
